  m_Name: Level3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Sentences:
  - text: Artois enters the heart of the castle, where the magic is strongest.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: The environment is surreal, with gravity-defying architecture, floating
      islands, and powerful magical anomalies.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: Artois must find Illian and either save him or confront him, depending
      on what has become of him.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: The grimoire's power is overwhelming, and Artois must use all his skills
      to survive.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
  - text: The grimoire's power is overwhelming, and Artois must use all his skills
      to survive.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 733acc94ff87c6941aab19cc51dacc95, type: 2}
